&#39; operations.    * **EntityUniqueId** - the unique ID of the step; if creating a new ad hoc step this must be distinct from any ids already in use by the system; ids can be retrieved using &#x60;/GetCurrentProjectionEntities&#x60; or &#x60;/GetProjectionData&#x60; if needed.    * **EntityName** - the name of the step; if the step name specified is NOT unique, the first step that matches the name is used; must match the EntityUniqueId if modifying an existing step.  See \&quot;Ad-hoc Projections\&quot; in the Integrators Reference.    (1) *No changes to the Process Step List, projection (&#x60;.ply&#x60;) file made by this endpoint will be saved, even if the Work Order is saved in Iris Client.*
        /// </remarks>
        /// <exception cref="VisionAndProjectionService.Swagger.Client.ApiException">Thrown when fails to make API call</exception>
