he polygon to remove, not the id.   While it can be used if provided with the name for backwards compatibility, any new implementation should be using **EntityNames** instead.  If you want to use **EntityNames**, then you should completely remove **EntityIds** by deleting the following code:   &lt;example&gt;               \&quot;EntityIds\&quot;: [                 \&quot;string\&quot;               ]               &lt;/example&gt;  Do **not** use both fields as EntityIDs will replace EntityNames if they are both provided.
